// Level 1: Oxbarrow Works (working name), an abandoned industrial compound.
// World frame: metres, x east, z south (north is −Z), y up. The compound wall encloses
// x −55…55, z −40…40; you start outside the main gate in the south wall, facing north.
// Perimeter wall segments: 0 north (x −55→55, at_m = x + 55), 1 east (z −40→40, at_m = z + 40),
// 2 south (x 55→−55, at_m = 55 − x), 3 west (z 40→−40, at_m = 40 − z).
{
  "id": "oxbarrow_works",
